      "default": "<p>I'm a technology consultant specializing in automation, data systems optimization, and full-stack development. With extensive experience architecting solutions for enterprise clients and growing businesses, I've helped organizations streamline operations, eliminate inefficiencies, and leverage technology to achieve measurable results.</p><p>My approach combines deep technical expertise with a focus on practical, business-driven outcomes. From building responsive web applications with React to engineering data validation systems with Python and SQL, I deliver solutions that solve real problems and create lasting value. My work has spanned industries including transportation, technology consulting, and digital media.</p><p>Through SkillShift, I'm committed to sharing the strategies, frameworks, and technical skills that drive success in today's digital economy. My courses are designed for professionals who want to advance their careers, entrepreneurs building their businesses, and anyone ready to master the tools that power modern technology.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
